OL,3,GNEWSAMajor delays caused by urgent rail
OL,4,Atrack repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have restarted after a
OL,7,Ftrack defect on a main rail line
OL,8,Fbrought delays and cancellations.
OL,10,FNational Rail said urgent repairs were
OL,11,Fcarried out on Friday morning to the
OL,12,Ftrack at Exeter St Davids, with
OL,13,Fdisruption continuing until 12:00 GMT
OL,14,Fand delays of up to 60 minutes.
OL,16,FTrain services between Exeter St Davids
OL,17,Fand Plymouth via Newton Abbot may be
OL,18,Fcancelled, delayed or revised, as well
OL,19,Fas services into Cornwall, according to
OL,20,FGreat Western Railway (GWR).
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
